<p>Hi <%= @attendee.name || "there" %>,</p>

<p>Here's your QR code for <strong><%= @event.name %></strong>. Scan this
when you arrive at the event to check in.</p>

<p>
  <%= image_tag @qr_png_cid, alt: "QR code for #{@event.name}", width: 300, height: 300, style: "max-width:100%;" %>
</p>

<p>You can also view the code directly at
  <%= link_to @url, @qr_page %>
</p>
